    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "MENU\nF\nC\nUNITED AIRLINES",
      "WINE LIST\nYOUR FLIGHT ATTENDANT WILL INFORM YOU\nOF TODAY'S SELECTIONS.\nWE ARE PLEASED TO PRESENT AN ARRAY OF FINE WINES\nCAREFULLY SELECTED FOR THEIR EXCELLENCE BY UNITED'S\nCELLAR COMMITTEE UNDER THE GUIDANCE OF WINE JUDGE\nAND AUTHOR, BOB THOMPSON.\nSPARKLING WINE\nDomaine Chandon Napa Valley Brut\nWHITE WINES\nBuena Vista Lake County Sauvignon Blanc 1994\nor\nFetzer Sundial Chardonnay 1993\nRED WINES\nSebastiani Cabernet Sauvignon 1991\nErrazuriz Maule Valley Merlot 1995\nIN\nTASTEFUL SAMPLING\nSmoked Salmon and oven-roasted Tomato,\nserved with Cilantro, Cucumber and Bell Pepper Salad\nGARDEN FRESH SALAD\nRed and Green Oakleaf Lettuce\nwith Plum Tomato, Enoki Mushrooms and Cucumber,\naccompanied by Parmesan Pepper or Javanese Dressing\n103D003-2\nM\nCOURSES\nMACADAMIA NUT PORK\nServed with Mango Basil Sauce,\nCarrot, Turnip and Celery Bâtonnets\nand Potato Croquettes with Red Bell Pepper Coulis\nBREAST OF CHICKEN PROVENÇAL\nRolled with Prosciutto, Asparagus,\nroasted Red Peppers and Ricotta Cheese,\ncomplemented by Red Bell Pepper Coulis,\nFondantes Potatoes and Green Beans with Pine Nuts\nCILANTRO GARLIC SHRIMP\nOffered with buttered Wild Rice,\nsautéed Carrots seasoned with Dill\nand Papaya Relish flavored with Pineapple\nGOURMET LICHTER AIR FARE\nChilled Chateaubriand presented in a lacquered box,\naccompanied by a spicy Rémoulade Sauce,\nsautéed Red Onions, Asparagus Tips, Vegetable Roll,\nPlum Tomato and Wild Rice with roasted Corn Salad\nALL\nICE CREAM SUNDAE\nBEN\u0026JERRY'S. Vanilla and Chocolate Ice Cream\nwith Hot Fudge Sauce and Wafer\nMisFields Cookies warm from the oven\nStarbucks. freshly brewed Coffee\nCrystal Geyser Natural Alpine Spring Water\nTRANS-CON (LD01)\n103D003-2\n7/96"
    ],
